{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-09-23 14:42:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY, PENN POWER DONATE AND PLANT NEARLY 130 TREES AT BUHL PARK', 'text': 'HERMITAGE, PA., SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TO CELEBRATE THE START OF THE FALL SEASON, FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) AND ITS ELECTRIC COMPANY PENN POWER RECENTLY DONATED NEARLY 130 TREES TO BUHL PARK IN HERMITAGE, PENNSYLVANIA.'}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-09-23 12:48:00', 'title': "FIRSTENERGY HONORED BY WOMEN'S BUSINESS ENTERPRISE CENTER FOR SUPPLIER DIVERSITY PROGRAMS", 'text': 'AKRON, OHIO, SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IN RECOGNITION OF ITS COMMITMENT TO SUPPLIER DIVERSITY AND WOMEN-OWNED BUSINESSES, FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) HAS BEEN PRESENTED WITH THE 2021 "REGIONAL COUNCIL MEMBER DONE DEALS" AWARD BY THE WOMEN\'S BUSINESS ENTERPRISE CENTER – EAST (WBEC-EAST).'}